// PHOTON CLOCK DERIVATION: Time Dilation from First Principles
//
// Setup: A \"photon clock\" consists of two mirrors separated by proper length L0.
// The train (frame S') moves at velocity v relative to the platform (frame S)
// along the +x axis. In S' the light bounces vertically between the mirrors
